{"id": "t053-001", "text": "Coffee with Helen. She's moved to Leeds now, works at the hospital there doing night shifts. Her brother Finn is living with her until he sorts his flat out. She reckons it'll be end of the month at the earliest, he keeps finding problems with every place. Helen's still doing her pottery class on Wednesdays and wants me to come along sometime, said she'd send me the details.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "moved to Leeds", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works at the hospital", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing night shifts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "living with her", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sorts his flat out", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of the month at the earliest", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery class", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesdays"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime"}]}
{"id": "t053-002", "text": "Tiago's new puppy is called Biscuit, a beagle cross. Already chewed two pairs of his trainers. Vet jabs are sometime next week. Need to ask him how the first one goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "new puppy is called Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "beagle cross", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Vet jabs", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how the first one goes", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t053-003", "text": "Long catch up with Ann and Bethany at the pub. Ann's gone vegan since January and is finding it easier than she expected. Bethany's still on the gluten free thing, she's coeliac so not optional. They both only drink oat lattes, noted for when they come round on 14 May.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegan", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since January"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "finding it easier than she expected", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bethany", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "gluten free", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "coeliac", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "only drink oat lattes", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "come round", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "14 May", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t053-006", "text": "Mustafa doesn't drink at all, so don't bring wine next time. He loves really strong black coffee and anything with pistachio.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't drink", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next time"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "strong black coffee", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pistachio", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t053-011", "text": "Bumped into Angela at the shop. She and Claire finally moved into the house in Didsbury, garden's tiny but they love it. Angela still at the bank, Claire teaching yoga part time. Their cat hated the move and hid under the bath for three days, but he's come round. They're having people over for a housewarming sometime in early March once the boxes are gone. Claire's mum is coming up from Kent for it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "moved into the house in Didsbury", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "garden's tiny", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f7", "type": "FACT", "text": "love it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "at the bank", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "teaching yoga part time", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three days"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in early March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "once the boxes are gone", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f6", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Kent", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}]}
{"id": "t053-012", "text": "Karan's the one who can't do dairy, not Divya. Divya's actually vegetarian. Get it right this time when booking the table for Saturday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Karan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "can't do dairy", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Divya", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this time", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "booking the table", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t053-015", "text": "Jaya told me about her brother Aleksander, he's a chef in Krakow and runs a pierogi place near the old town. She says he's thinking of moving back to London over the summer. Her dad's not well either, heart stuff, so she's going out there sometime in October to see them both.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jaya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aleksander", "pronoun": "he", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "chef in Krakow", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "runs a pierogi place", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving back to London", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "not well", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "heart stuff", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going out there", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in October", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t053-021", "text": "Akira is Japanese but grew up in Manchester. Big into fermenting things, kimchi, kombucha, miso. Yuki is his sister, she's at uni in Glasgow doing medicine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Japanese", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "grew up in Manchester", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "fermenting things", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "kimchi", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "kombucha", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i4", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "miso", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yuki", "pronoun": "she", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "at uni in Glasgow doing medicine", "fact_type": "job", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t053-024", "text": "Mrs Morris next door is 80 on 17 April. Her son is organising a lunch at the Swan. She mentioned she'd love some new gardening gloves.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Morris", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "next door", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "80", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "17 April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lunch at the Swan", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "love some new gardening gloves", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t053-025", "text": "Saw Tiago and his girlfriend Fiona, they're moving to Bristol at the end of the month. He's transferring with work, she's still looking. Fiona's a bit anxious about it, she's never lived away from her family. Their leaving drinks are on the 24th at the Crown. I should get them a little something for the new place, maybe a plant.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "transferring with work", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Fiona", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit anxious", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "family", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "leaving drinks", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 24th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get them a little something for the new place", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t053-029", "text": "Lwazi's dog Simba got out on Sunday and was missing overnight, found him two streets away. All fine now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Simba", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "overnight", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t053-030", "text": "Need to book my own flu jab sometime next week.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book my own flu jab", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flu jab", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t053-031", "text": "Uncle Mustafa is visiting from Cairo 12th to 26th of August. Staying with Nasser. He only eats halal and loves sweets, so baklava when we see him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Mustafa", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting from Cairo", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "12th to 26th of August", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "only eats halal", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "sweets", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "baklava", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "on", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "when we see him", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t053-035", "text": "Anan lives with his grandparents in Leyton. Works nights at a warehouse while doing an Open University course in engineering.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandparents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Leyton", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Works nights at a warehouse", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing an Open University course in engineering", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t053-037", "text": "Catch up with Esther. She's adopting a second cat sometime over the summer, a ginger one from the shelter. Her first cat Mabel is apparently very jealous already. Esther works from home so she says it's fine. I'm feeding them while she's in Wales 9th to 13th August.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "adopting a second cat", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime over the summer", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "first cat Mabel", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Esther", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works from home", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "in Wales", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "9th to 13th August", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t053-042", "text": "Liam's going to Australia for three months from early February, visiting his brother Sam in Perth. Sam's wife is due in March so Liam wants to be there for that. Remind me to get something small for the baby before Liam goes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going to Australia", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "three months", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "from early February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "in Perth", "fact_type": "home", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sam", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get something small for the baby", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Liam", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t053-046", "text": "Akira's moving out of the flat on 31/10 and into a houseboat on the canal, of all things. He's buzzing about it. I'm helping him carry stuff that weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Akira", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving out of the flat", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "31/10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "houseboat on the canal", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "buzzing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "that weekend", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t053-047", "text": "Rang Helen. Her dog Rolo has been limping for a fortnight, x-ray booked for the 15th of November. Her husband thinks it's arthritis. She's quite worried, he's only six. Her kids are taking it hard too. I'll check in with her after the x-ray and maybe drop round some of those dog treats he likes.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Helen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Rolo", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "limping", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "x-ray", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 15th of November", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quite worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "taking it hard", "owner": "r2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the x-ray", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t053-052", "text": "Talked to Lwazi and his wife for ages at the school gate. They're from Durban originally, moved over in 2015. Their eldest has a nut allergy, really serious, so they check everything at parties. Lwazi says she's in the netball team now and has her first match on Saturday. He's nervous for her.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "ages"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Durban originally", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved over", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in 2015", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nut allergy", "fact_type": "diet", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lwazi", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "in the netball team", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first match", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "r2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t053-053", "text": "Ann's daughter is getting a puppy for her birthday on 4th April, Ann's sworn me to secrecy. Cockapoo apparently.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting a puppy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "4th April", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Cockapoo", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t053-054", "text": "Mustafa Khan, Nasser's cousin, works as a pharmacist in Bolton. Two kids, both into football.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mustafa Khan", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nasser", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cousin", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works as a pharmacist in Bolton", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "football", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t053-058", "text": "Talked to Tiago again about Biscuit. Vet said he has a slight heart murmur but nothing to worry about yet, recheck in six months. Tiago's partner Bruno wants to get a second dog, Tiago is not convinced.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Biscuit", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slight heart murmur", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "recheck", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in six months", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Bruno", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants to get a second dog", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p3"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tiago", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "not convinced", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t053-059", "text": "Claire said the party for Angela's 40th on 18 Jan is cancelled, Angela doesn't want a fuss. They're doing a quiet dinner in instead. Angela loves a Negroni, apparently, so a nice bottle of Campari could be the move.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Claire", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "40th", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "18 Jan", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doesn't want a fuss", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "quiet dinner in", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Angela", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "Negroni", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "nice bottle of Campari could be the move", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "p2"}]}
